// Soldier models, baked into assets/models.pak by tools/gc_artbake
// (`cargo run -p gc_artbake --release`). `name` is the unit type each model
// dresses, exactly as in data/units.ron. Sources marked `shared:` live in the
// project's shared assets folder because their packs may not be
// redistributed raw (docs/16-art-sourcing.md); `repo:` sources are in
// assets-src/ here. `textures` lists painted maps for models whose detail
// is in textures rather than vertex colours. `lod_triangles` budgets the four
// levels of detail, from full to the one drawn smallest. Clip kinds: Idle,
// Walk, Run, Attack, Attack2, Hit, Die, Cheer, Shoot, Block (a model without
// a Block clip guards with its Idle). The bake also writes
// assets/models.manifest, which `gc_artbake --check` compares with this file
// and the sources in CI: re-bake and commit both after editing here.
(
    models: [
        (
            name: "Yari Ashigaru",
            // Made for Grubcraft in Blender on Quaternius's Farmer body and
            // rig (docs/09-art-and-audio.md, Fidelity); the spear rides the
            // right wrist.
            source: "shared:grubcraft/yari-ashigaru/yari-ashigaru.glb",
            height: 1.6,
            clips: {
                "Idle": "Idle_Sword", "Walk": "Walk", "Run": "Run", "Attack": "Sword_Slash",
                "Attack2": "Punch_Right", "Hit": "HitRecieve", "Die": "Death", "Cheer": "Wave",
            },
            lod_triangles: (8400, 3000, 1000, 350),
            textures: Some((
                albedo: "shared:grubcraft/yari-ashigaru/albedo.png",
                team: Some("shared:grubcraft/yari-ashigaru/team.png"),
